    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Parts of clothing",
     "texto": [
      "**Penutup kepala** is a garment that covers the head; **hiasan** is a decoration. The meaning of clothing varies according to the group and the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
